Cloudflare Pages uses this directory as the "Root directory" for the
thrivingincollege.org project. It must exist in git for Pages to cd into it.

Everything else here is generated by the build and is gitignored:
  functions/  <- compiled by Pages, never served
  dist/       <- the build output directory, the only public part

  BASE= OUT_DIR=thrive-launch/dist node thrivingincollege/build.js
